  "description": "An embeddable storage engine for .NET, built on a write-ahead log over RocksDB: databases, boxes (named ordered key spaces) and records; atomic batches across boxes; snapshots and bounded ordered scans; durability you choose; primary/standby replication; incremental online backup and restore; format stamps.",
