  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: 1.0.0-rc.3 with only the version changed, approved by Highway, a product running on it. The public API follows semantic versioning from here. New since rc.2: offline compaction, a database's latest position, promotion past an epoch floor, unfencing at the same epoch, a standby's link to its primary, and box handles from the catalogue listing. Source-breaking changes from rc.2 (Box, ReplicationStatus.Role, box locks, ApproximateBytes, exception constructors); see CHANGELOG.md in the repository. Tested on Windows and Linux.",
